      "title": "v0.66.1",
      "description": "A few bug fixes for regressions introduced with the last release, and also some for older bugs.\r\n\r\nOne visible change is that the narrow selection bar in the focused diff view is now shown on both sides of the view rather than just on the left. This should improve usability for users with very large monitors, especially when using a side-by-side diff renderer.\r\n\r\nFor the changes of the last big release, see [v0.66.0](https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/releases/tag/v0.66.0).\r\n\r\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.66.1 -->\r\n\r\n## The changes in detail\r\n### Enhancements \ud83d\udd25\r\n* Allow scrolling the diff view horizontally when gui.wrapLinesInDiffView is off by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6109\r\n* Show the diff view's narrow selection bar on the right edge too by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6105\r\n### Fixes \ud83d\udd27\r\n* Fix staging diff hunks when the diff.mnemonic git config is true by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6099\r\n* Show errors for unresolvable diff lines by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6100\r\n* Fix double-width characters in the last column drawing over the view's frame by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6106\r\n* Fix search match highlighting when a custom patch is active by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6107\r\n* Open files of a branch's diff from the worktree that has it checked out by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6104\r\n* Don't log the diff renderer probe in the command log by @stefanhaller in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/6112\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/compare/v0.66.0...v0.66.1\r\n\r\n",
      "tag": "v0.66.1",
